{"id": "mf-ja-001", "lang": "ja", "text": "潤滑不足がベアリングの焼き付きを引き起こした。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "潤滑不足", "type": "Cause", "id": "MF:poor_lubrication"}, {"start": 5, "end": 10, "text": "ベアリング", "type": "Component", "id": "MF:bearing"}, {"start": 11, "end": 15, "text": "焼き付き", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:seizure"}], "relations": [{"head": 2, "tail": 0, "type": "CAUSED_BY", "negated": false}, {"head": 1, "tail": 2, "type": "HAS_FAILURE_MODE", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-002", "lang": "ja", "text": "異物混入によりコンベヤで詰まりが発生した。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "異物混入", "type": "Cause", "id": "MF:contamination"}, {"start": 7, "end": 11, "text": "コンベヤ", "type": "Machine", "id": "MF:conveyor"}, {"start": 12, "end": 15, "text": "詰まり", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:jam"}], "relations": [{"head": 2, "tail": 0, "type": "CAUSED_BY", "negated": false}, {"head": 2, "tail": 1, "type": "OCCURS_AT", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-003", "lang": "ja", "text": "温度センサが主軸の過熱を検知した。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 5, "text": "温度センサ", "type": "Sensor", "id": "MF:temperature_sensor"}, {"start": 6, "end": 8, "text": "主軸", "type": "Component", "id": "MF:spindle"}, {"start": 9, "end": 11, "text": "過熱", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:overheating"}], "relations": [{"head": 2, "tail": 0, "type": "DETECTED_BY", "negated": false}, {"head": 1, "tail": 2, "type": "HAS_FAILURE_MODE", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-004", "lang": "ja", "text": "ホースの漏れは部品交換で修理した。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 3, "text": "ホース", "type": "Component", "id": "MF:hose"}, {"start": 4, "end": 6, "text": "漏れ", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:leak"}, {"start": 7, "end": 11, "text": "部品交換", "type": "MaintenanceAction", "id": "MF:replacement"}, {"start": 12, "end": 14, "text": "修理", "type": "MaintenanceAction", "id": "MF:repair"}], "relations": [{"head": 1, "tail": 2, "type": "FIXED_BY", "negated": false}, {"head": 0, "tail": 1, "type": "HAS_FAILURE_MODE", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-005", "lang": "ja", "text": "塗装工程で短絡が発生した。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "塗装工程", "type": "Station", "id": "MF:paint_shop"}, {"start": 5, "end": 7, "text": "短絡", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:short_circuit"}], "relations": [{"head": 1, "tail": 0, "type": "OCCURS_AT", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-006", "lang": "ja", "text": "主軸はマシニングセンタの一部である。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "text": "主軸", "type": "Component", "id": "MF:spindle"}, {"start": 3, "end": 11, "text": "マシニングセンタ", "type": "Machine", "id": "MF:cnc_machine"}], "relations": [{"head": 0, "tail": 1, "type": "PART_OF", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-007", "lang": "ja", "text": "予防保全は腐食を防止する。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "予防保全", "type": "Countermeasure", "id": "MF:preventive_maintenance"}, {"start": 5, "end": 7, "text": "腐食", "type": "Cause", "id": "MF:corrosion"}], "relations": [{"head": 0, "tail": 1, "type": "PREVENTS", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-008", "lang": "ja", "text": "かんばんはプレスラインの過負荷を防ぐ。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "かんばん", "type": "TPSConcept", "id": "MF:kanban"}, {"start": 5, "end": 11, "text": "プレスライン", "type": "Station", "id": "MF:press_line"}, {"start": 12, "end": 15, "text": "過負荷", "type": "Cause", "id": "MF:overload"}], "relations": [{"head": 0, "tail": 2, "type": "PREVENTS", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-009", "lang": "ja", "text": "芯ずれが異常振動を引き起こす。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 3, "text": "芯ずれ", "type": "Cause", "id": "MF:misalignment"}, {"start": 4, "end": 8, "text": "異常振動", "type": "Observation", "id": "MF:vibration"}], "relations": [{"head": 1, "tail": 0, "type": "CAUSED_BY", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-010", "lang": "ja", "text": "エンストは異物混入が原因ではなかった。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "エンスト", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:stall"}, {"start": 5, "end": 9, "text": "異物混入", "type": "Cause", "id": "MF:contamination"}], "relations": [{"head": 0, "tail": 1, "type": "CAUSED_BY", "negated": true}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-011", "lang": "ja", "text": "金属疲労がギアボックスの破断を引き起こす可能性がある。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "金属疲労", "type": "Cause", "id": "MF:fatigue"}, {"start": 5, "end": 11, "text": "ギアボックス", "type": "Component", "id": "MF:gearbox"}, {"start": 12, "end": 14, "text": "破断", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:fracture"}], "relations": [{"head": 2, "tail": 0, "type": "CAUSED_BY", "negated": false}, {"head": 1, "tail": 2, "type": "HAS_FAILURE_MODE", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-012", "lang": "ja", "text": "画像センサが組立ラインで詰まりを検出した。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 5, "text": "画像センサ", "type": "Sensor", "id": "MF:camera"}, {"start": 6, "end": 11, "text": "組立ライン", "type": "Station", "id": "MF:assembly_line"}, {"start": 12, "end": 15, "text": "詰まり", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:jam"}], "relations": [{"head": 2, "tail": 0, "type": "DETECTED_BY", "negated": false}, {"head": 2, "tail": 1, "type": "OCCURS_AT", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-013", "lang": "ja", "text": "アンドンは異常発生時にラインを止める。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "アンドン", "type": "TPSConcept", "id": "MF:andon"}], "relations": [], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-014", "lang": "ja", "text": "点検でブレーキパッドの摩耗が見つかった。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "text": "点検", "type": "MaintenanceAction", "id": "MF:inspection"}, {"start": 3, "end": 10, "text": "ブレーキパッド", "type": "Component", "id": "MF:brake_pad"}, {"start": 11, "end": 13, "text": "摩耗", "type": "Cause", "id": "MF:wear"}], "relations": [], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-015", "lang": "ja", "text": "ボルトの緩みがコンプレッサーの振動の原因である。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 6, "text": "ボルトの緩み", "type": "Cause", "id": "MF:loose_bolt"}, {"start": 7, "end": 14, "text": "コンプレッサー", "type": "Machine", "id": "MF:compressor"}, {"start": 15, "end": 17, "text": "振動", "type": "Observation", "id": "MF:vibration"}], "relations": [{"head": 2, "tail": 0, "type": "CAUSED_BY", "negated": false}, {"head": 2, "tail": 1, "type": "OCCURS_AT", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-016", "lang": "ja", "text": "モーターの過熱が短絡を引き起こした。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "モーター", "type": "Component", "id": "MF:motor"}, {"start": 5, "end": 7, "text": "過熱", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:overheating"}, {"start": 8, "end": 10, "text": "短絡", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:short_circuit"}], "relations": [{"head": 2, "tail": 1, "type": "CAUSED_BY", "negated": false}, {"head": 0, "tail": 1, "type": "HAS_FAILURE_MODE", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-017", "lang": "ja", "text": "給油はベアリングの摩耗を防ぐ。", "entities": [{"start": 0, "end": 2, "text": "給油", "type": "MaintenanceAction", "id": "MF:lubrication"}, {"start": 3, "end": 8, "text": "ベアリング", "type": "Component", "id": "MF:bearing"}, {"start": 9, "end": 11, "text": "摩耗", "type": "Cause", "id": "MF:wear"}], "relations": [{"head": 0, "tail": 2, "type": "PREVENTS", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
{"id": "mf-ja-018", "lang": "ja", "text": "衝突時にエアバッグの不展開が発生した。", "entities": [{"start": 4, "end": 9, "text": "エアバッグ", "type": "Component", "id": "MF:airbag"}, {"start": 10, "end": 13, "text": "不展開", "type": "FailureMode", "id": "MF:failure_to_deploy"}], "relations": [{"head": 0, "tail": 1, "type": "HAS_FAILURE_MODE", "negated": false}], "source": "seed"}
